2Ki 7:1 , Elisha prophesies incredible plenty in Samaria;
2Ki 7:3 , Four lepers, venturing on the host of the Syrians, bring tidings of their flight;
2Ki 7:12 , The king, finding by spies the news to be true, spoils the tents of the Syrians;
2Ki 7:17 , The lord who would not believe the prophecy of plenty, having the charge of the gate, is trodden to death in the press.
